[
    {
        "content": "<p>If I have <code>abc123</code>, is it possible to write a parser that parses it as two tokens, <code>abc</code>, and <code>123</code>?</p>\n<p>For example, if I have</p>\n<div class=\"codehilite\" data-code-language=\"Lean4\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"n\">declare_syntax_cat</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">mystery</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">syntax</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"s2\">\"a\"</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">num</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">mystery</span>\n</code></pre></div>\n<p>Then <code>a123</code> would not fit into this syntax.</p>",
        "id": 580898512,
        "sender_full_name": "Leni Aniva",
        "timestamp": 1774167703
    },
    {
        "content": "<p>Cf. <a class=\"stream-topic\" data-stream-id=\"239415\" href=\"/#narrow/channel/239415-metaprogramming-.2F-tactics/topic/noWs/with/512389177\">#metaprogramming / tactics &gt; noWs</a> </p>\n<p>The <code>noWs</code> solution doesnt work for some reason</p>",
        "id": 580898785,
        "sender_full_name": "Leni Aniva",
        "timestamp": 1774167990
    },
    {
        "content": "<p>I also tried this:</p>\n<div class=\"codehilite\" data-code-language=\"Lean4\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"kn\">import</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Lean</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">Parser</span>\n\n<span class=\"kn\">open</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Lean</span>\n\n<span class=\"n\">declare_syntax_cat</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">mystery</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">abbrev</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">labelKind</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">SyntaxNodeKind</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"ss\">`label</span>\n\n<span class=\"kn\">def</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">labelFn</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Parser</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">ParserFn</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">fun</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">ctx</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">s</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">=&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"k\">let</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">s</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Parser</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">tokenFn</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">[</span><span class=\"s2\">\"abc\"</span><span class=\"o\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"s2\">\"bcd\"</span><span class=\"o\">]</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">ctx</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">s</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"k\">if</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">!</span><span class=\"n\">s</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">hasError</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">then</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">s</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">mkUnexpectedTokenError</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"s2\">\"unexpected token in label\"</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">else</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">s</span>\n\n<span class=\"kn\">def</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">label</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Parser</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">Parser</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">{</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"n\">fn</span><span class=\"w\">   </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">labelFn</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"n\">info</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Parser</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">mkAtomicInfo</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"s2\">\"label\"</span>\n<span class=\"o\">}</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">syntax</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">label</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">num</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">mystery</span>\n</code></pre></div>\n<p>which shows</p>\n<div class=\"codehilite\" data-code-language=\"Lean4\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"n\">don't</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">know</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">how</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">to</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">generate</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">formatter</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">for</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">non</span><span class=\"bp\">-</span><span class=\"n\">definition</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">`</span><span class=\"o\">{</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">info</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Parser</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">mkAtomicInfo</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"s2\">\"label\"</span><span class=\"o\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">fn</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">labelFn</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">}</span><span class=\"bp\">`</span>\n</code></pre></div>",
        "id": 580899874,
        "sender_full_name": "Leni Aniva",
        "timestamp": 1774168987
    },
    {
        "content": "<p>The <code>noWs</code> solution doesn't work here because it tries to parse the token as an identifier before looking it up in the token table; that is, it parses <code>abc123</code> as an identifier and then sees that there is no token named <code>abc123</code> and fails. Also, the <code>expected</code> argument of <code>tokenFn</code> doesn't actually do anything, it's just there for error messages. You can use <a href=\"https://leanprover-community.github.io/mathlib4_docs/find/?pattern=Lean.Parser.rawFn#doc\">docs#Lean.Parser.rawFn</a> and others here to make your idea work:</p>\n<div class=\"codehilite\" data-code-language=\"Lean4\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"kn\">import</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Lean</span>\n\n<span class=\"kn\">open</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Lean</span>\n\n<span class=\"n\">declare_syntax_cat</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">mystery</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">abbrev</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">labelKind</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">SyntaxNodeKind</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"ss\">`label</span>\n\n<span class=\"kn\">def</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">labelFn</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Parser</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">ParserFn</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"n\">Parser</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">nodeFn</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">labelKind</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">&lt;|</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"n\">Parser</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">rawFn</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">trailingWs</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">true</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">fun</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">ctx</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">s</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">=&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"k\">let</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">slice</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">ctx</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">substring</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">s</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">pos</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">ctx</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">endPos</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"k\">if</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">let</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">some</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">slice</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">slice</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">dropPrefix?</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"s2\">\"abc\"</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">toRawSubstring</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">then</span>\n<span class=\"w\">      </span><span class=\"n\">s</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">setPos</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">slice</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">startPos</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"k\">else</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">if</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">let</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">some</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">slice</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">slice</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">dropPrefix?</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"s2\">\"def\"</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">toRawSubstring</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">then</span>\n<span class=\"w\">      </span><span class=\"n\">s</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">setPos</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">slice</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">startPos</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"k\">else</span>\n<span class=\"w\">      </span><span class=\"n\">s</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">mkErrorsAt</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">[</span><span class=\"s2\">\"abc\"</span><span class=\"o\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"s2\">\"def\"</span><span class=\"o\">]</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">s</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">pos</span>\n\n<span class=\"kn\">def</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">labelNoAntiquot</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Parser</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">Parser</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">where</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"n\">fn</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">labelFn</span>\n\n<span class=\"kn\">open</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">PrettyPrinter</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Formatter</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">in</span>\n<span class=\"kd\">@[</span><span class=\"n\">combinator_formatter</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">labelNoAntiquot</span><span class=\"kd\">]</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">def</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">labelNoAntiquot</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">formatter</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Formatter</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"n\">visitAtom</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">labelKind</span>\n\n<span class=\"kn\">open</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">PrettyPrinter</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Parenthesizer</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">in</span>\n<span class=\"kd\">@[</span><span class=\"n\">combinator_parenthesizer</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">labelNoAntiquot</span><span class=\"kd\">]</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">def</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">labelNoAntiquot</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">parenthesizer</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Parenthesizer</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">visitToken</span>\n\n<span class=\"kn\">def</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">label</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Parser</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">withAntiquot</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">Parser</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">mkAntiquot</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"s2\">\"label\"</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">labelKind</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">labelNoAntiquot</span>\n\n<span class=\"kn\">syntax</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">label</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">noWs</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">num</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">mystery</span>\n\n<span class=\"kn\">elab</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"s2\">\"test \"</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">m</span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"n\">mystery</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">command</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">=&gt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">do</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"k\">let</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">`</span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">mystery</span><span class=\"bp\">|</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">$</span><span class=\"n\">l</span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"n\">label</span><span class=\"bp\">$</span><span class=\"n\">n</span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"n\">num</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">m</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">|</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Elab</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">throwUnsupportedSyntax</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"k\">let</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">label</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">l</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">raw</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">isLit?</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">labelKind</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">getD</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"s2\">\"abc\"</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"n\">logInfo</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">m!</span><span class=\"s2\">\"{label}</span><span class=\"se\">\\n</span><span class=\"s2\">{n.getNat}\"</span>\n\n<span class=\"n\">test</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">abc123</span>\n</code></pre></div>\n<p>The <code>combinator_formatter</code> and <code>combinator_parenthesizer</code> remove the error you've mentioned and then we finally wrap <code>labelNoAntiquot</code> in <code>withAntiquot</code> to make sure we can write <code>$l:label</code> as demonstrated below. Also, instead of using <code>noWs</code>, you could also disable <code>trailingWs</code> for the <code>rawFn</code> parser but the behavior with <code>noWs</code> is a bit more predictable.</p>",
        "id": 580908404,
        "sender_full_name": "Robin Arnez",
        "timestamp": 1774175995
    },
    {
        "content": "<p><span class=\"user-mention silent\" data-user-id=\"873547\">Robin Arnez</span> <a href=\"#narrow/channel/239415-metaprogramming-.2F-tactics/topic/Parse.20alpha.20and.20num.20separately/near/580908404\">said</a>:</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p>The <code>noWs</code> solution doesn't work here because it tries to parse the token as an identifier before looking it up in the token table; that is, it parses <code>abc123</code> as an identifier and then sees that there is no token named <code>abc123</code> and fails. Also, the <code>expected</code> argument of <code>tokenFn</code> doesn't actually do anything, it's just there for error messages. You can use <a href=\"https://leanprover-community.github.io/mathlib4_docs/find/?pattern=Lean.Parser.rawFn#doc\">docs#Lean.Parser.rawFn</a> and others here to make your idea work:</p>\n<div class=\"codehilite\" data-code-language=\"Lean4\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"kn\">import</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Lean</span>\n\n<span class=\"kn\">open</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Lean</span>\n\n<span class=\"n\">declare_syntax_cat</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">mystery</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">abbrev</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">labelKind</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">SyntaxNodeKind</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"ss\">`label</span>\n\n<span class=\"kn\">def</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">labelFn</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Parser</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">ParserFn</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"n\">Parser</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">nodeFn</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n